abstract: >-
  GuidedSDG is a Large Language Model (LLM) assisted workflow
  for synthetic tabular data generation and evaluation. It guides
  users through data preparation, generator selection, synthetic
  data generation, and evaluation, and incorporates
  human-in-the-loop (HITL) interactions that let users review and
  revise agent recommendations throughout the workflow.
